+++ b/docs/comment1_revision.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+Comment 1 editorial revision -- November 7, 2026
+
+Current review source: wileyNJD-APA.tex; local PDF: wileyNJD-APA.pdf.
+The six main sections now proceed from the forecasting problem and data roles
+to model, computation, application/evaluation, results, and discussion. The main
+text retains the definitions needed by priors; full selector/augmentation algebra
+and algorithms are linked through stable appendix labels.
+
+The revision clarifies the twelve transfer predictors, scaling and state
+dimensions, daily rotation units, actual VB workflow and predictive synthesis.
+It repairs citations, abbreviations, accents, reference padding and decimal
+grouping. Seven context/synthesis panels use matching line/marker keys at article
+size; the long-cycle title/caption is corrected. Numerical results, fitted models,
+selected run identities and generated table numbers remain the authority.
+
+Build a fresh review with scripts/build_manuscript_review.py; see README.md.
+The figure registry verifies source hashes and selected identities before
+restoring reviewed presentation assets. Its source/command/style provenance is
+in artifacts/comment1_figure_revision/. Source-data changes require renewed
+rendering and review. The canonical image tree is uppercase Figures/.
+
